----------------------------------
The desktop agent daemon under crates/loams-agentd* includes MIT-licensed
code inherited from zeron (https://github.com/zeronsh/zeron), Copyright (c)
2026 Wing, together with Loams additions. The crates that carry
`license = "MIT"` derive from zeron through the Loams Desktop fork, at the
commit recorded in crates/loams-agentd/import-provenance.json. The other
loams-agentd* crates are Apache-2.0. crates/loams-agentd/README.md lists the
licence of each crate. crates/loams-agentd/ holds the daemon's LICENSE, NOTICE,
